<p> Maize     3,772    3.2  (4.8)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
<p> Soybeans    n/a    n/a  (n/a)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
<p> Sunflower 2,994    3.2  (0.9)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
